  },
  {
   "id": "p1l",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 594,
   "width": 428,
   "height": 90,
   "strokeColor": "#b91c1c",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100029,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700203,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "If the coordinator dies here, both participants sit with\nprepared transactions and LOCKS HELD INDEFINITELY. They\ncannot decide alone: committing risks a mint if the other\naborted, aborting risks losing a committed transfer. So a\nprepared participant must BLOCK. Both accounts freeze,\nand so does every transfer touching them.",
   "originalText": "If the coordinator dies here, both participants sit with\nprepared transactions and LOCKS HELD INDEFINITELY. They\ncannot decide alone: committing risks a mint if the other\naborted, aborting risks losing a committed transfer. So a\nprepared participant must BLOCK. Both accounts freeze,\nand so does every transfer touching them.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
