   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "For two legs, near-identical to TC/C. TC/C wins on two\ncounts: its phases are PARALLELIZABLE (a 5-way split\npayment confirms all five at once), and its Try phase\nexpresses RESERVATION - 'hold $10' is a weaker, useful\noperation Saga has no vocabulary for.",
   "originalText": "For two legs, near-identical to TC/C. TC/C wins on two\ncounts: its phases are PARALLELIZABLE (a 5-way split\npayment confirms all five at once), and its Try phase\nexpresses RESERVATION - 'hold $10' is a weaker, useful\noperation Saga has no vocabulary for.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
